{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached, move, grab and check if can lift, then process properties, or do task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectAround    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = CheckIfCanLift    /> <Action ID = DoTask    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectProperties    />\"",
