    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectAround? THEN\n\t\t\tDO MoveToObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO TakeObject\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectHeavy? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO CheckIfCanLift\n\t\tEND\n\t\tSELECTOR\n\t\t\tDO ProcessObjectProperties\n\t\t\tDO DoTask\n\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
